Description: libHX helper library (Office Unbound build)
 Data structure and utility library by Jan Engelhardt, built from the pinned
 upstream tag for Office Unbound because Gromox requires a newer version than
 Debian 12 ships. Package is namespaced (ou-) and replaces the Debian runtime.

